    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">43 kW</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">
