    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">United States federal income tax consequences applicable to the warrants; and</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
